%% 05 · Conversation runtime — server/runtime_graph.py and event-driven player
flowchart TD
  START["Customer starts Explore or Browse<br/>[ASK · welcome Voice mode switch]<br/>default on iff continuous voice and no mute=1; typing always available"]:::ask
  MODE["Connect session socket for guide speech<br/>[FUNCTION · startLive / runtime_live.py]<br/>voice on: one capture request; off: mic.set false, no permission prompt<br/>player Voice mode switch and mic button share capture ownership without reconnecting"]:::fn
  TRANSPORT{"Explicit voice_transport=livekit URL flag?<br/>[FUNCTION · web/app.js]<br/>absent: existing socket; trial: local enabled server only"}:::dec
  LK["Opt-in local LiveKit trial<br/>[LIBRARY · livekit-voice.js / livekit_trial.py]<br/>one existing capture publishes microphone over WebRTC<br/>scoped short-lived room token; owner + capture generation bound<br/>reliable fragmented data carries existing controls and owned PCM output<br/>explicit failure on disconnect; no replay, second voice or autonomous agent<br/>same-machine private host ICE; localhost signaling; mock providers and separate publication copy by default"]:::data
  INPUT["Continuous PCM capture<br/>[LIBRARY · live-voice.js / voice-worklet.js]<br/>sustained speech-like local frames may open a reversible hold; a raw volume spike cannot<br/>AEC requested; capture generation owns ready/transcript/error events"]:::data
  STT["Realtime STT over private session WebSocket<br/>[LIBRARY · runtime_live.py / sarvam_stream.py]<br/>qualified partial may open a reversible hold; only qualified final owns a semantic turn<br/>known throat/cough annotations and standalone ahem cannot qualify via punctuation<br/>active prompt / question / product / command checks; local Continue/Pause/Stop/Not now"]:::data
  HOLD["Quiet the guide locally before server recognition completes<br/>[FUNCTION · live-voice.js / player.js]<br/>pause current recorded/streamed audio and visual transition without cancelling its owner<br/>final speech commits interruption; rejected/no-final input resumes the same clip position<br/>silence and bounded no-progress watchdog prevent a permanent hold<br/>not speaker identification; sustained TV speech may cause a temporary pause"]:::fn
  INTAKE["One needs question; wait for a real reply<br/>[FUNCTION · player.js runIntake]<br/>retain actual needs; generic show-me-around uses neutral acknowledgement and default route<br/>optional website field selects only owner-authorized domains"]:::fn
  FILM["Optional opening film when selected by the existing flow<br/>[FUNCTION · playIntroFilm]<br/>native-fit video + Skip below; hide slide shell<br/>end/error/Skip restores player; obsolete run cannot resume"]:::fn
  OVERVIEW["Grounded overview in the selected voice<br/>[DATA · bundle.runtime.overview]<br/>10–15 second target measured from generated audio"]:::data
  PERSONALIZE["Explore graph node → pitch.plan_pitch<br/>[AGENT · Gemini → Claude → Runware]<br/>order reviewed slides; explicit priority revision may revisit selected seen proof"]:::agent
  ROUTE["Validate route and personalized segments<br/>[FUNCTION · pitch.py / narration.default_route / player.js]<br/>first fundamental + buyer order; extend whole proof stops to published selected duration (default180s)<br/>all continuation batches stay together, including features/establish<br/>pre-tour Q&A does not shorten speech; reviewed closing stays intact<br/>explicit short/refine exempt; legacy seen policy unchanged"]:::fn
  PLAY["Narration owns the screen<br/>[FUNCTION · player.js / slide.js]<br/>one voice; current source picture + reviewed callouts before main speech<br/>workbook shell: white surface, template-dark text; unchanged top nav and white conversation dock<br/>welcome/intake: native hero; slide heading/footer and75% viewport stage stay fixed<br/>picture-free slides: exact reviewed native text; Align stays native<br/>speak closing statements; skip legacy question checkins without speech or wait<br/>save checkin_skipped: legacy_question on the run<br/>after each logical section: invite questions, then owned three-second listen"]:::fn
  WALK["Default middle-slide gallery<br/>[FUNCTION · walkthrough.js presentation adapter]<br/>walk → enlarge → reviewed feature focus; playLines awaits ready before existing speech call<br/>consecutive same-photo slides retain settled frame; changed feature alone may refocus<br/>source media/line bindings; same-line second picture stays available in selectable inset<br/>exact labels; trusted anchors only, no proxy or guessed pointer<br/>native heroes, no-picture and asset-failure fallback; presentation=native diagnostic<br/>reduced motion removes camera motion; pause/question/stop cancel stale transitions<br/>player retains route, voice, checkpoint and resume ownership; no new agent/node"]:::fn
  STOP["Stop local audio and cancel old turn/delivery<br/>[FUNCTION · live-voice.js / runtime_live.py]<br/>save return point; discard stale turn/utterance/generation output"]:::fn
  ACK["Query acknowledgement only<br/>[DATA · selected-voice filler]<br/>ten neutral phrases rotate per visit; exact matching clip or locked runtime voice<br/>fast answers and local commands skip holding speech<br/>retrieval starts concurrently; filler is not useful-answer latency"]:::data
  SHOW{"Unambiguous picture-only request?<br/>[FUNCTION · run_turn wrapper]<br/>show-me-around and combined factual questions stay on ordinary path"}:::dec
  PICTURE["Resolve a reviewed picture without reasoning<br/>[FUNCTION · run_turn wrapper / runtime_visuals.py]<br/>ordinary scoped retrieval; at most four published caption hints change ranking only<br/>matching pinned snapshot + publication version; eligible own-caption subject and local media<br/>show exact non-illustrative photo or say no reviewed image is available<br/>no claim, reasoning call, FAQ cache write or customer unknown"]:::fn
  CACHE{"Candidate saved answer before graph?<br/>[FUNCTION · run_turn → faq.match]<br/>same pinned snapshot + registry hash; eligible citations<br/>skip_bank bypasses; rejected tombstones never match"}:::dec
  CACHEVALID{"Cached words valid for this question?<br/>[FUNCTION · _validated_bank_result]<br/>ordinary scope/date-aware retrieval + exact-text grounding<br/>eligible citations, conditions, collective engine/gearbox mappings and word cap; fresh URL/search requests bypass"}:::dec
  HIT["Exact cached answer + available clip<br/>[DATA · faq.json]<br/>from_bank=true; increment asked_count<br/>unchanged validated words; derive current evidence view; no reasoning call"]:::data
  SITES["Owner-authorized domains and selected pages<br/>[DATA · active demo URL sources + session selections]<br/>only enabled, non-excluded top-level owner URLs grant permission; recheck before tool use<br/>failed build crawl does not revoke consent<br/>www/apex equivalent; other subdomains need explicit owner source<br/>customer words/history/uploads cannot authorize another domain; no owner URL means no web"]:::data
  RETRIEVE["Retrieve pinned approved evidence<br/>[FUNCTION · knowledge.retrieve]<br/>BM25 + local ranking; request-local universal scope; pinned condition dependencies<br/>hydrate returned facts only; each selected source extraction read once per request<br/>same ranking, snapshot, context and eligibility; no persistent cache"]:::fn
  REASON["Answer, clarify, or request bounded tool<br/>[AGENT · runtime_graph.reason]<br/>history + explicit profile + evidence + CUSTOMER_URLS + tool results<br/>explicit URL verification first; explicit search remains available<br/>empty evidence / first clean decline: allowed page first, same-domain search if still unanswered"]:::agent
  CHOICE{"Decision action?<br/>[FUNCTION · after_reason]"}:::dec
  TOOLS["Dispatch bounded tool<br/>[FUNCTION · runtime_tools.py]<br/>calculator / owner-domain page lookup / domain-constrained web search<br/>max 2 tool rounds / 4 calls; graph deadline 12 seconds"]:::fn
  WEB["Owner-domain search: explicit or evidence fallback<br/>[FUNCTION + LIBRARY · web_search / Gemini discovery]<br/>site-constrained discovery + at most two allowed page fetches, ≤5 seconds<br/>reject outside-domain discovery/redirects before fetching; original market/model guards<br/>whole fetched passages become attributed turn-local W evidence; snippets/prose do not<br/>one public search; no greeting/control/CTA/clarify/calculator-only/outage fallback<br/>negated or quoted search excluded; no facts or FAQ mutation"]:::fn
  LOCALTOOL["Calculator or allowed customer-site lookup<br/>[FUNCTION · calculate / source_lookup]<br/>exact operand units/basis + formula; scoped public pages and whole table passages<br/>live W facts require cited-host attribution; never enter approved registry"]:::fn
  VALIDATE["Validate sentences; retain supported portion<br/>[FUNCTION · runtime_graph.validate]<br/>grounding + collective engine/gearbox mappings → everyday substitutions → exact live attribution → rendered word cap<br/>unmapped blocked term: technical_term feedback; technical requests bypass register only"]:::fn
  REPAIR["One optional composition repair<br/>[AGENT · runtime_graph._repair_composition]<br/>same approved evidence + precise rejection feedback; no tools or CTA<br/>only if at least 3 seconds remain inside the same 12-second deadline"]:::agent
  RECHECK["Revalidate repaired sentences<br/>[FUNCTION · validate_decision]<br/>accept fully checked useful content; partial repairs retain rejection telemetry<br/>otherwise retain original supported result; cancellation always wins"]:::fn
  PLAN["Checkpoint a versioned DeliveryPlan<br/>[DATA · runtime_state.py]<br/>snapshot, turn/utterance ID, result + plain_language_substitutions<br/>next interaction; no audio in graph"]:::data
  LEARN["Learn only after validation<br/>[FUNCTION · faq.cache_answer / record_unknown]<br/>clean sourced answer: customer entry, reviewed=false, count + pin/hash<br/>decline or I-will-not-guess: deduplicated customer unknown, never a fact<br/>no clarification, provider/repair failure, live-web or calculation answer cached"]:::fn
  BANK["Asked and answered review<br/>[DATA · faq.json + understanding.json unknowns]<br/>content change resets card approval; count/audio-only update does not<br/>Coach reads customer unknowns as evidence gaps"]:::data
  VIEW["Evidence view: exact reviewed picture on stay / jump / none<br/>[FUNCTION · delivery_plan / runtime_visuals.py / player.js]<br/>validated answer and FAQ hits resolve cited picture + owning caption from same pin/version<br/>client rechecks exact slide, image id, URL and caption ownership; await selected image before speech<br/>same-slide second picture can change; no guessed pointer or stale cached visual<br/>runtime-v1 starts on evidence without extra spoken bridge; saved return point stays stable"]:::fn
  SPEAK["Request selected-voice streaming delivery<br/>[LIBRARY · runtime_delivery.py → Sarvam Bulbul v3]<br/>validated answer first, PCM chunks second; cancel closes its socket<br/>thirty-second inactivity deadline after buffered playback; progress refreshes it<br/>completed customer answer clip saved through voice text-hash cache<br/>late clip can attach only to the same entry and exact words"]:::data
  LISTEN["Section / answer / decline reply window: 3000 ms<br/>[FUNCTION · holdConversation]<br/>chips + focused typing; voice-mode capture open<br/>qualified final speech, typing or chip takes turn; early speech hold temporarily suspends timer<br/>raw volume alone cannot hold it; rejected hold resumes the owned reply window<br/>legacy started capture may finish after auto-resume within12s; same session/listen owner<br/>deliberate server capture keeps freeform answers; new input/control/mute cancels stale delivery<br/>decline offers follow-up button only; Not now dismisses and resumes"]:::fn
  WAIT["Clarification or active customer turn<br/>[ASK · reply / Continue / configured CTA]<br/>no silence timer; wait for customer action"]:::ask
  CORRECT["Explicit changed priority<br/>[FUNCTION · player.js]<br/>replan relevant proof; explicit reviewed revisits allowed; apply on Continue from closing"]:::fn
  RESUME["Resume saved narration; interrupted line starts again<br/>[FUNCTION · resumeAfterQA]<br/>automatic return: recorded back_to_demo only, else silence<br/>explicit Continue: resume acknowledgement; never query filler<br/>auto_resumed + listen window saved on the turn"]:::fn
  CTA["Customer selects next step + separately consents to contact<br/>[ASK · existing lead form]<br/>form opens only after explicit choice; viewport-contained grid<br/>no model-triggered submission; dismissal does not reopen it"]:::ask
  SAVE["Save heard transcript, timings, recap and consent<br/>[DATA · sessions / traces / runtime_metrics.py]<br/>one-second debounced changes + fifteen-second heartbeat + visibility/exit checkpoint<br/>immutable heard prefix; ordered bounded queue, retry same sequence; stale server writes ignored<br/>input_mode saved; consented private contact masked in public recap<br/>missing/cancelled timings visible; small samples labelled"]:::data
  FAIL["Supported partial answer or temporary limitation<br/>[FUNCTION · bounded failure]<br/>no outage cached as a knowledge gap"]:::fn
  START --> INTAKE
